# Watchman crontab (Linux / macOS). Install with:  crontab scripts/crontab.example
# (or `crontab -e` and paste the lines below, editing the path first).
#
# ── TIMEZONE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The US market runs on America/New_York (ET). The CRON_TZ line below makes the
# schedule below ET regardless of the machine's local zone. If your cron does
# NOT support CRON_TZ (older Vixie cron), delete it and convert the times to
# your machine's local timezone yourself.
CRON_TZ=America/New_York
#
# Edit this to your checkout path:
#   WATCHMAN_HOME=/home/you/AI-Stock-Market-Trading-Investing-scanner
WATCHMAN_HOME=/REPLACE/WITH/PATH/TO/AI-Stock-Market-Trading-Investing-scanner
#
# ── DAILY RHYTHM (weekdays only; Mon-Fri = 1-5) ──────────────────────────────
# 08:05 ET  pre-market scan -> focus list, and the morning brief
5 8 * * 1-5   "$WATCHMAN_HOME/scripts/watchman_run.sh" morning
#
# Every 5 minutes 09:35-15:55 ET: evaluate setups on each completed bar,
# resolve open paper trades, auto-take new signals. (Runs at :35..:55 of the
# open hour and :00..:55 of the rest, stopping before the close.)
35,40,45,50,55 9 * * 1-5    "$WATCHMAN_HOME/scripts/watchman_run.sh" intraday
*/5 10-15 * * 1-5           "$WATCHMAN_HOME/scripts/watchman_run.sh" intraday
#
# 16:15 ET  after the close: final resolve/expire, evening recap, HTML report
15 16 * * 1-5  "$WATCHMAN_HOME/scripts/watchman_run.sh" evening
#
# ── PERIODIC ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sunday 18:00 ET  refresh the Module A screener watchlist + deteriorators
0 18 * * 0    "$WATCHMAN_HOME/scripts/watchman_run.sh" weekly
#
# New/upcoming listings (Module F) + data-driven verdicts. NEEDS a Finnhub or
# FMP key (yfinance has no IPO calendar); leave commented if you're on yfinance.
# Weekdays 07:30 ET, before the open:
# 30 7 * * 1-5   "$WATCHMAN_HOME/scripts/watchman_run.sh" debuts
#
# 1st of the month, 18:30 ET  long-term paper rebalance into the screener top-N
30 18 1 * *   "$WATCHMAN_HOME/scripts/watchman_run.sh" monthly
